                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "English-speaking Australians have always had a love affair with <w>slang</w>."
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "After years when I met a friend inside the aircraft and could sense stiffness in the conversation, a whiff of mild <w>slang</w> was the ice breaker."
